  "generated_overview": "The official 24/7 league is running four active strategies across two families (Cosmo & Wanda and Timmy) on Top 20 and Top 50 pair universes. Timmy Top 50 is the only net-positive strategy with clean telemetry and a statistically meaningful sample (111 trades), while both Cosmo & Wanda variants hold nominal equity leads but suffer from severe unrealized decay and exit-discipline concerns. Timmy Top 20 is structurally underwater, confirming pair breadth is a binding constraint for that phenotype. The league is currently focused on validating post-restart behavior and isolating whether exit mechanics or universe sizing are the primary determinants of net economic performance."
